    "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dichroic stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence at normal angle. Initialize layer thicknesses to iteration_20 best candidate values: [77.18, 127.42, 59.02, 106.51, 103.69, 102.04, 251.49, 58.47, 224.32, 105.91, 53.27, 91.43, 222.25, 66.18, 67.71, 74.85, 55.68, 94.62, 161.84, 234.50, 54.81, 81.35, 186.93, 53.33] nm. Fix layers 4-19 (indices 4 through 19 inclusive) to these exact values. Allow gradient-based thickness optimization only on layers 0-3 and 20-23 with bounds 50-280 nm. Score using coherent TMM at normal incidence, unpolarized light, over 400-1600 nm wavelength range. Optimize for simultaneous mean transmittance maximization in 1530-1565 nm and mean reflectance maximization in 400-700 nm bands. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
